sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Mobile as Expo Mobile App
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant PaymentService as Payment Service
  participant PaymentDb as payment
  participant BookingService as Booking Service
  participant BookingDb as booking

  Customer->>Mobile: Reserve payment for booking
  Mobile->>Gateway: POST /v1/payments
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate customer token
  Gateway->>PaymentService: POST /internal/payments
  PaymentService->>BookingService: Confirm booking visibility and amount
  BookingService->>BookingDb: Read booking summary
  BookingDb-->>BookingService: BookingSummary
  BookingService-->>PaymentService: Booking amount and participants
  PaymentService->>PaymentDb: Calculate fees and upsert payment reservation
  PaymentDb-->>PaymentService: PaymentSummary
  PaymentService-->>Gateway: PaymentSummary
  Gateway-->>Mobile: Payment reserved
  Mobile-->>Customer: Show payment status
